title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "LWUSP" and police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/greiser.jpg

= Internal Security

The Interior Ministry controls internal security throughout the Republic of <span style="color: #6e377a;">Sord</span><span style="color: #ffd000;">land</span>. While some police work is delegated to the , the national security agency can perform special investigations.

As with the state police units and the Army, the internal police tends to be <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span>, and has serious issues with loyalty to the elected government of the Republic.


- @privatize_prisons: Allow private prisons.
- @loyalty: Improve the loyalty of the Interior Ministry forces.
- @hire_interior: Recruit additional police.
- @_domestic_enemies: Investigate or ban our domestic enemies.
- @gendarmerie: Transfer the Gendarmerie to the Interior.
- @amnesty: Amnesty for Soll-era prisoners.
- @root: Take no action for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@privatize_prisons
subtitle: +1 budget.
view-if: privatized_prisons < 2
on-arrival: budget += 1; privatized_prisons += 1; cwusp_relation -= 3; rwusp_relation -= 5; workers_lwusp -= 1*(1-dissent); bff_strength += 5; ys_strength += 15; ry_strength += 15

Now that we have privatized prisons, we'll be able to invest more elsewhere.

@loyalty
on-arrival: interior_police_loyalty += 0.1

There are measures we can take to root out <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> and anti-democratic sentiment in the police. We can improve training and recruiting procedures, and identify and remove known <span style="color: #7e0b80;">Sollists</span> and the like.

Current interior police loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]

@hire_interior
on-arrival: interior_police_strength += 10

We have recruited additional police.

@gendarmerie
view-if: lwusp_in_government and defense_minister_party = 'LWUSP'
on-arrival: interior_police_strength += 20; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; army_strength -= 30; army_loyalty -= 0.1; coup_progress += 2; ys_strength -= 30; ry_strength -= 30; bff_strength -= 5

We have transferred the Gendarmerie, previously under the <span style="color: #808080;">Army</span>, to the Interior. The Armed Forces are displeased.

@amnesty
on-arrival: cps_relation += 5; wpb_relation += 5; pro_republic += 2; socialism += 2; nationalism -= 3; rwusp_relation -= 5; nfp_relation -= 2

We have proclaimed an amnesty for Soll-era prisoners, mostly radical democrats and <span style="color: #c00000;">socialists</span>.
